@startuml
title Story 4 — Ranking by Decade
actor User
participant "Browser UI" as UI
participant "app.js" as JS
participant "Rankings API\n/ api/rankings/by-decade" as DecadeAPI
participant "IBGE (Rankings per decade)" as IBGE
User -> UI: select decade (e.g., 1990)
UI -> JS: onChange -> loadDecadeRanking()
JS -> DecadeAPI: GET /api/rankings/by-decade?decada=1990&sex=all&state=BR
DecadeAPI -> IBGE: (optional) query IBGE with decade parameter
IBGE --> DecadeAPI: top10 for decade
DecadeAPI --> JS: 200 decade-top10 JSON
JS -> UI: render decade ranking (no reload)
@enduml
